    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a vitae inhabiting the form of a fungus. These eidolons are as varied as the many fungi on the world and beyond. Though others may have trouble relating to the strange nature of your eidolon, your ability to share senses with your eidolon has given you a unique outlook on life.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> Primal</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> eidolon, fungus</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> the Universe</p><hr /><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> spore pod (bludgeoning), claw (slashing), jaw (piercing)</p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> <em>Con</em> +2, <em>Int</em> -1, <em>Wis</em> +2, <em>Cha</em> +0</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Nature, Survival</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> Fey</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 20 feet</p><hr /><p><strong>Initial (1st) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.igM8MehFJFLeehpq]{Fungal Hyphae}</strong></p><p><strong>Symbiosis (7th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.guiJEdOqOFu9cGGn]{Release Spores}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><p><strong>Transcendence (17th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.al59m7JCx4xSXJ1a]{Fungal Domination}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><hr /><p>The summoner's half of this eidolon is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.summons-unleashed.Item.GYjwkUj9M9hCmi3G]{Mycological Eidolon} in the Summons Unleashed compendium.</p>"
